ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 GlancePage / DrivesListPage precedents)
  ExplorePageModel.kt      framework-free: ExplorePageRegistration (ROUTE_ID/WEB_PATH/SLUG/RECENT_LIMIT),
                           ExploreGating (web minVehicles fleetCompare>=2 + requiresAuth set + isVisible),
                           ExploreEntry / ExploreSection / HighlightSegment / ExploreSuggestion / ExploreGate,
                           exploreGateResource (freshness-preserving Resource fold), filterExploreCatalog
                           (web filterFeatureCatalog), groupExploreCatalog (web groupFeatureCatalog),
                           highlightExplore (web Highlight splitter), closestExploreRoutes + levenshtein
                           (web closestRoutes), recordExplorePageOpened (view.opened diagnostic).
  ExplorePageStrings.kt    ExploreDescriptions: webPath -> @StringRes desc id (web DESCRIPTIONS record), with a
                           localized `Open %1$s.` fallback; resolved off the Compose boundary via Context.getString.
  ExplorePageSource.kt     seam over VehiclesStore.vehicles (web useVehicles) + AuthModeStore.isForwardAuth
                           (web useIsForwardAuth) + RecentPagesStore (web getRecentPages); refresh re-fetches auth.
  ExplorePageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel; uiState: StateFlow<UiState<ExploreGate>> = refreshTrigger
                           ▸ flatMapLatest(combine(vehicles, isForwardAuth) ▸ exploreGateResource) ▸ asUiState
                           (isEmpty=false, so the catalog is never gated behind a spinner); recent StateFlow;
                           refresh/retry; recordViewOpened.
  ExplorePage.kt           stateful entry + stateless content; PageLoader first-frame loader; header (title +
                           live subtitle + DataFreshness + retry); recently-visited strip; search panel
                           (GlassPanel1) + anchor strip; categorized feature-card grid (FlowRow, 2-up) with
                           query highlight; no-results empty panel (GlassPanel2) + did-you-mean suggestions +
                           clear; pane title = explore.pageTitle (web usePageTitle). Forward navigation through
                           the shared LocalDeepLinkRouter seam (no NavController is exposed to page hosts).
  ExplorePageHost.kt       ExploreRoute + ExplorePageHost.register() for the `explore` /explore destination
                           (Destinations.kt L51); page-local AuthModeStore over the shared client+cache (the DI
                           graph wires no app-wide AuthModeStore, as the GlancePageHost VehicleCommandStore notes)
                           + SharedPreferencesRecentPagesStore(LocalContext).
  TeslaSyncApplication.kt  ExplorePageHost.register() wired into onCreate (NavHost registration).
  res/values/strings.xml   13 translation_explore_* keys + translation_explore_cardFallback + 103
                           translation_explore_desc_* descriptions added (well-formed XML, 8347 strings total).

DATA SOURCES (each bound through the ViewModel exposing StateFlow from the KMP core, P1/S8)
  useVehicles        → ExplorePageViewModel.uiState (vehicleCount gate) ← ExplorePageSource.vehicles
                       ← VehiclesStore.vehicles; gates the `/vehicle-comparison` (fleetCompare>=2) card.
  useIsForwardAuth   → ExplorePageViewModel.uiState (auth gate) ← ExplorePageSource.isForwardAuth
                       ← AuthModeStore.isForwardAuth; hides myActivity/account2fa/accountSessions in open mode.
  getRecentPages     → ExplorePageViewModel.recent ← ExplorePageSource.recentPages ← RecentPagesStore
                       (SharedPreferences, the web localStorage recent-pages registry); resolved against the
                       visible catalog for the recently-visited strip.
  Catalog source: RouteTable.drawerSections (the same localized nav registry the Android sidebar uses, the
  analogue of the web `navSections`); labels via navTitleRes, sections via navGroupTitleRes, icons via navIcon,
  descriptions via ExploreDescriptions — folded into ExploreEntry at the Compose boundary (LayoutStrings precedent).

