EXTRA WEB-PARITY (anonymous regions from the web source, beyond the manifest's 17-item contract; no narrowing)
  recently-visited strip   ExplorePage.kt ExploreRecentStrip — resolves the on-device recent-pages list against the
                           visible catalog (web `recentResolved`), shown only when not filtering (web `!query`).
  section-anchor strip     ExplorePage.kt ExploreAnchorStrip — one chip per section + match count (web
                           SectionAnchorStrip); the web jump-links become a labeled section index on touch.
  feature cards            ExplorePage.kt ExploreFeatureCard — icon box + label + 2-line description, navigating via
                           the DeepLinkRouter (web FeatureCard `<a>`), laid out as a 2-up FlowRow grid.
  query highlight          ExplorePage.kt HighlightedText + highlightExplore — query-token runs wrapped in a primary
                           wash (web `<mark>`), inside both the card label and description.
  did-you-mean suggestions ExplorePage.kt ExploreEmptyResult + closestExploreRoutes — Levenshtein closest routes over
                           the visible catalog (web `closestRoutes`/`EmptyResult`).
  live subtitle            ExplorePage.kt ExploreHeader — `{{matches}} of {{total}}` / `{{total}} in total` (web subtitle).
  freshness + retry        ExplorePage.kt ExploreHeader DataFreshness + retry — the bound feed's refreshing/stale/
                           offline state + a retry affordance; the catalog renders regardless (web defaults vehicleCount=0).
  loading                  ExplorePage.kt:159 uiState.isLoading -> PageLoader (centered spinner; the brief first frame
                           before the vehicle/auth StateFlows emit, never blank).
  diagnostics              ExplorePageViewModel.recordViewOpened -> recordExplorePageOpened (PII-safe view.opened, slug only).

